{%- comment -%}
  N°98 Maps: Our story page.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign n98_handle = section.settings.configurator_handle | default: 'design-your-map'
  assign n98_url = routes.root_url | append: '/products/' | append: n98_handle | replace: '//', '/'
-%}
{%- case request.locale.iso_code -%}
{%- when 'nl' -%}
{% render 'n98-page-styles' %}
<div class="n98h n98p">
<style>
.n98p .n98p-prose { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr); gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px); }
.n98p .n98p-prose h2 { margin: 14px 0 0; }
.n98p .n98p-prose .n98p-text p { font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 19px); line-height: 1.75; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-2); }
.n98p .n98p-prose .n98p-text p + p { margin-top: 1.2em; }
.n98p .n98p-quote { padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 128px) 0; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.n98p .n98p-quote blockquote { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 18em; font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 58px); line-height: 1.12; }
.n98p .n98p-coords { margin-top: 26px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: var(--mute); }
.n98p .n98p-values { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 40px; }
.n98p .n98p-value { border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.n98p .n98p-value .n98-num { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; }
.n98p .n98p-value h3 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.n98p .n98p-value p { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 300; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .n98p .n98p-prose { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

  <section class="n98p-hero">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <p class="n98-eyebrow">Ons verhaal</p>
      <h1>Sommige plekken <em>blijven bij je.</em></h1>
      <p class="n98p-lede">De straat waar je opgroeide. De stad waar jullie elkaar ontmoetten. De kust waar je steeds naar terugkeert. N°98 Maps maakt van die plekken rustige, doordachte prints, elk speciaal voor jou gemaakt.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98p-sec">
    <div class="n98-wrap n98p-prose">
      <div>
        <p class="n98-eyebrow">Waarom N°98</p>
        <h2>Een kaart is een herinnering <em>die je kunt ophangen.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="n98p-text">
        <p>N°98 begon met een simpele ergernis: de meeste kaartposters lijken op elkaar. Dezelfde letters, dezelfde kleuren, hetzelfde handjevol steden. De plekken die voor mensen het meest betekenen, stonden er zelden tussen.</p>
        <p>Dus bouwden we onze eigen kaartstudio. Elke straat, rivier en kustlijn wordt getekend door onze eigen software, en elk palet is met de hand samengesteld om aan de muur te hangen, van Midnight Gold tot Glacier Mist. Jij kiest de plek, de kleuren en de woorden. Wij zorgen dat hij prachtig gedrukt wordt.</p>
        <p>N°98 is een kleine studio uit Nederland. We drukken op bestelling, dichtbij waar jij bent, zodat er niets gemaakt wordt dat niemand wilde en je kaart zo kort mogelijk onderweg is.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98p-quote">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <blockquote>&ldquo;Geen stad van een lijstje. Jouw plek, in jouw woorden.&rdquo;</blockquote>
      <p class="n98p-coords">52.3676° N · 4.9041° E</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98p-sec">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <p class="n98-eyebrow">Waar we om geven</p>
      <h2>Met aandacht gemaakt, <em>gratis verstuurd.</em></h2>
      <div class="n98p-values">
        <div class="n98p-value"><span class="n98-num">I</span><h3>Ontwerp voorop</h3><p>Elk palet, lettertype en elke lijndikte is gekozen om rustig en tijdloos te ogen, niet schreeuwerig.</p></div>
        <div class="n98p-value"><span class="n98-num">II</span><h3>Precies zoals je hem zag</h3><p>De preview die je goedkeurt, is precies het bestand dat we naar de drukker sturen. Geen verrassingen.</p></div>
        <div class="n98p-value"><span class="n98-num">III</span><h3>Op bestelling gemaakt</h3><p>Niets ligt op de plank. Elke kaart wordt vers gedrukt, na je bestelling.</p></div>
        <div class="n98p-value"><span class="n98-num">IV</span><h3>Gratis verzending</h3><p>Op elke bestelling naar Europa, het VK en de VS. De prijs die je ziet, is de prijs die je betaalt.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98p-cta">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <p class="n98-eyebrow">Jouw beurt</p>
      <h2>Welke plek <em>blijft bij jou?</em></h2>
      <a class="n98-btn" href="{{ n98_url }}">Ontwerp je kaart <svg width="18" height="10" viewBox="0 0 18 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 5h16M12 1l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
{%- else -%}
{% render 'n98-page-styles' %}
<div class="n98h n98p">
<style>
.n98p .n98p-prose { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr); gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px); }
.n98p .n98p-prose h2 { margin: 14px 0 0; }
.n98p .n98p-prose .n98p-text p { font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 19px); line-height: 1.75; font-weight: 300; color: var(--ink-2); }
.n98p .n98p-prose .n98p-text p + p { margin-top: 1.2em; }
.n98p .n98p-quote { padding: clamp(64px, 10vw, 128px) 0; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.n98p .n98p-quote blockquote { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 18em; font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 58px); line-height: 1.12; }
.n98p .n98p-coords { margin-top: 26px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: var(--mute); }
.n98p .n98p-values { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 40px; }
.n98p .n98p-value { border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.n98p .n98p-value .n98-num { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; }
.n98p .n98p-value h3 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.n98p .n98p-value p { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 300; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .n98p .n98p-prose { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

  <section class="n98p-hero">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <p class="n98-eyebrow">Our story</p>
      <h1>Some places <em>stay with you.</em></h1>
      <p class="n98p-lede">The street where you grew up. The city where you met. The coastline you keep returning to. N°98 Maps turns those places into quiet, considered prints, each one made just for you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98p-sec">
    <div class="n98-wrap n98p-prose">
      <div>
        <p class="n98-eyebrow">Why N°98</p>
        <h2>A map is a memory <em>you can hang.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="n98p-text">
        <p>N°98 started with a simple frustration: most map posters look the same. The same fonts, the same colours, the same handful of cities. The places that matter most to people rarely made the list.</p>
        <p>So we built our own map studio. Every street, river and coastline is drawn by our own software, and every palette is composed by hand to live on a wall, from midnight gold to glacier mist. You choose the place, the colours and the words. We make sure it prints beautifully.</p>
        <p>N°98 is a small studio from the Netherlands. We print on demand, close to wherever you are, so nothing is made that nobody wanted and your map travels as short a distance as possible.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98p-quote">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <blockquote>&ldquo;Not a city on a list. Your place, in your words.&rdquo;</blockquote>
      <p class="n98p-coords">52.3676° N · 4.9041° E</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98p-sec">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <p class="n98-eyebrow">What we care about</p>
      <h2>Made slowly, <em>shipped freely.</em></h2>
      <div class="n98p-values">
        <div class="n98p-value"><span class="n98-num">I</span><h3>Design first</h3><p>Every palette, typeface and line weight is chosen to look calm and timeless, not loud.</p></div>
        <div class="n98p-value"><span class="n98-num">II</span><h3>Exactly as you saw it</h3><p>The preview you approve is the very file we send to print. No surprises.</p></div>
        <div class="n98p-value"><span class="n98-num">III</span><h3>Made to order</h3><p>Nothing sits in a warehouse. Each map is printed fresh, after you order.</p></div>
        <div class="n98p-value"><span class="n98-num">IV</span><h3>Free shipping</h3><p>On every order to Europe, the UK and the US. The price you see is the price you pay.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="n98p-cta">
    <div class="n98-wrap">
      <p class="n98-eyebrow">Your turn</p>
      <h2>Which place <em>stays with you?</em></h2>
      <a class="n98-btn" href="{{ n98_url }}">Design your map <svg width="18" height="10" viewBox="0 0 18 10" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 5h16M12 1l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
{%- endcase -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "N°98 our story",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "configurator_handle", "label": "Configurator product handle", "default": "design-your-map" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
